TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium, 1 kg pure water, pH 7, fixed PO2
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)  -0.7 10
    Pyrite 0    0.1
    Goethite 0  0
    Gypsum   0  0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -alkalinity true
    -totals S(6) Fe Ca
END
